USING THE INDEX.HTML IN THE SDR OSI REPO IN CONJUNCTION WITH FS5000_SERIAL.PY AND GEIGER_LIVE_SERVER.PY

AND THE FINAL PIECE IS JUST A CAPTURE OF AN UNENCLOSED FS-5000 IN THE SAME PLACE, SO YOU CAN SEE THE OVERLAP,
YOU CAN SEE UNDER ANALYSIS, THE SIGNATURES FALL INTO PLACE ON THE BIGGER PICTURE. YOU CAN SEE WHICH SIGNATURES 
ARE REUSED BY MULTIPLE LOCATIONS. BUT MOST IMPORTANTLY, IT MAKES THE SIGNATURES DEFINED, 
AND TAKES AWAY THE NOISE THAT HIDES THEIR SIGNATURES.

from what this exposes, its a multidirectional crossfire attack"


NOW THESE ARE ALL TAKEN SEPERATELY, WHICH MEANS THEY DONT NECESSAIRLY OVERLAP TEMPORALLY. 
HOWEVER,
IF I WERE TO IDENTIFY WHERE THE SIGNATURES ARE ANCHORED ON THE ALL SIGNATURES FILE, YOU MIGHT START TO REBUILD THEIR TIMING PATTERN, 
MEANING,
WE HAVE AN EXACT SEQUENCE COMING FROM A CERTAIN DIRECTION, WE FIND IT IN THE ALL DIRECTIONS FILE.
WE FIND EXACT SEQUENCES OF ZEROS RUNNING CONSECUTIVELY. WE WONT FIND IT IN THE ALL DIRECTIONS FILE,
HOWEVER,
THE OTHER LOCATIONS WHEN ADDED AT THEIR ANCHOR POINTS TO A CONGREGATED FILE, MIGHT START TO REBUILD THIS ZERO BUFFER AND WILL LOOK NEARLY IDENTICAL TO THE ALL DIRECTIONS FILE WHEN PROPERLY PLACED.

THE PROBLEM WITH THIS METHOD IS STILL THE CAPTURES ARE NOT HAPPENING AT THE SAME TIME, AND YOURE DEPENDING ON THE PATTERNS PREDICTIBILITY TO SHOW ITSELF IN THE RESULT.

THIS ISNT NECESSAIRLY INCORRECT, BUT IT DOES MEAN THAT A MORE EXACT RECORDING METHOD CAN BE CONSTRUCTED.
FROM THIS, WE CAN TAKE 5 GEIGER COUNTERS, AND 4 ENCLOSURES, POINTED NORTH SOUTH EAST AND WEST, AND HAVE THE 5TH GEIGER COLLECTING ALL DIRECTIONS, RUNNING AND LOGGING EXACTLY AT THE SAME TIME

THIS IS A MUCH BETTER PLACE TO START THE SIGNATURE REBUILDING BECAUSE THE GROUND TRUTH IS THE ALL DIRECTIONS, WHILE THE OTHER DIRECTIONS ARE SEGMENTS OF THE SAME PATTERN.

WE CAN THEN SEE, HOW EFFECTIVE THE SHIELDING EVEN IS AGAINST SOME OF THE READINGS (ITS EFFECTIVE, BUT HOW EFFECTIVE? IF WE  ADD ALL THE IGNATURES OTHER THAN ALL DIRECTIONS TOGETHER AT THE SAME START AND FINISH TIME, IS THERE OVERLAP THATS NOT PRESENT IN THE ALL DIRECTION FILE?)

BUT FOR THE MOST PART, IT WILL LOOK NEARLY IDENTICAL TO THE ALL DIRECTIONS FILE WHEN CONGREGATED. AT THAT POINT , YOUR SIGNATURES ARE CONFIRMED FOR THE DIRECTION IN WHICH THE ENCLOSURE IS POINTED.










